{
  "id": "MAT.28",
  "number": "28",
  "bookId": "MAT",
  "reference": "Mɛ̈T 28",
  "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN",
  "verseCount": 20,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "28",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MAT 28"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "28",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jiëc Yecu li̱th",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kɛ kɔr ca̱ŋ lɔ̱ŋä ji̱ Juudh, bakä ɣɔaa kɛ cäŋ in jio̱liɛn, cu Mɛri raan Mag-da-la kɛ Mɛri in dɔ̱ŋ gua̱a̱th kunyä wä gui̱l. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ, cuɛ tekɛ lath piɛny mi di̱i̱t, kɛ ɣöö ci jääk Kua̱r ni Kuɔth ben piny nhial, cuɛ päm rial gekä thok kɔ̱kä, kä cuɛ nyuur wi̱i̱dɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä buɔy guec pua̱nydɛ ce̱tkɛ yiel nhial, kä bieynikɛ buɔykɛ ce̱tkɛ kɛ kën. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu yiëën dual ɛlɔ̱ŋ kɛ jääk, a bikɛ ce̱tkɛ nɛy ti ci li̱w. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu jääk Kuɔth nhial män jiök i̱, “/Cuarɛ dual, kɛ ɣöö ŋa̱cä jɛ ɛn ɣöö görɛ ni Yecu ëë ca pua̱t jiaath. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Thilɛ jɛ ɛn wanɛ, jɛn cɛ rɔ jiɛc li̱th, ce̱tkɛ mëë cɛ lar. Bia nɛnɛ gua̱a̱th ëë ca tɔ̱a̱c thi̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wiaa kɛ pɛ̈th, kä la̱rɛ jɛ ji̱ kɔaarɛ ɛn ɣöö cɛ rɔ jiɛc li̱th, kä jɛn wëë kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li kɛ nhiam kä yɛ. Bia jɛ wä nɛn ɛn wi̱ni, kä tiɛtdɛ mëë cä la̱r yɛ.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cukɛ jiɛɛn kɛ pɛ̈th guäth kunyä, kɛ dual kɛnɛ tɛ̈th lɔaac mi di̱i̱t, kä cukɛ riŋ kɛ ɣöö bikɛ jɛ wä la̱r ji̱ kɔaarɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä nɛnɛ, cu Yecu röm kɛ kɛ, cuɛ wee i̱, “Malɛ!” Cukɛ ben kä jɛ, cukɛ jɛ käp ciökni, kä cukɛ jɛ pal. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu kɛ jiök i̱, “/Cuarɛ dual, wiaa la̱rɛ jɛ dämaari ɛn ɣöö bikɛ wä kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, kä bikɛ ɣä wä nɛn ɛn wi̱ni.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Lär yiëëni kɛ min ci tuɔɔk",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä min wä män cu tha̱a̱ŋ yiëëni wä rɛy rɛ̈ɛ̈k, kä cukɛ ti diaal tin ci tuɔɔk wä la̱t bööth palä tin di̱t. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ rɔ̱ dol kɛɛl kɛ di̱t nath cukɛ ruac kärɔ̱, cukɛ yio̱w ti ŋuan ka̱m lathkëëri, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wäkɛ i̱, “La̱rɛ jɛ naath ɛn ɣöö ci ji̱ kɔaarɛ ben kɛ wäär, kä cikɛ puɔ̱nydɛ kual mëë ta̱kɔ ni̱n. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mi wä rueec mɛmɛ liŋ, bakɔ lɔcdɛ jakä ro̱ŋ, kä bia kään rɛy rikä.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä inɔ cukɛ yio̱w ka̱n, kä cukɛ jɛ la̱t ce̱tkɛ min ca la̱r kɛ. Kä ruac ɛmɛ ŋotdɛ latkɛ jɛ rɛy ji̱ Juudh amäni wa̱lɛ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Jäk jaakni Yecu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Täämɛ cu ji̱ kɔaarɛ da̱ŋ wäl kɛl wä kä Gɛ̈-lɛ-li, wäkɛ wi̱i̱ pa̱a̱m in ci Yecu ɛ nyuɔ̱th kɛ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä mëë cikɛ jɛ nɛn, cukɛ jɛ pal, kä te tha̱a̱ŋkiɛn kɛ diw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu Yecu ben kä kɛ, cuɛ kɛ jiök i̱, “Lua̱ŋ nhial kɛnɛ piny kɛɛliw ca jɛ ka̱m ɣä. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä wiaa, kä jakɛ naath kä ji̱ kɔaarä rɛy dööri diaal, kä lakɛ kɛ kɛ ciöt Gua̱a̱r in te nhial, kɛ Gat, kɛ Yiëë in Gɔaa in Rɛl Rɔ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 28:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kä ŋi̱eecɛ kɛ, kɛ ɣöö bikɛ ruaacni diaal tin ca la̱t yɛ luɔ̱th. Kä tiɛmɛ jɛ, ɣän a kɛɛl kɛ yɛ ni ciaŋ amäni guut ɣɔaa.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.28.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.28.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
